-10-17","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/testing-dark-waters-2018-10-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/testing-dark-waters-2018-10-17#:~:text=whatever%27s%20causing%20this%20sizzle%20is%20powerful.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Testing the Dark Waters\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 17 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"testing-dark-waters-2018-10-17-e3","summary":"Leighbet opens a grate with stored mana, finds a spatial rift ringed by plants, and survives an eel shock after her canister explodes.","participants":["leighbet","spatial-rift"],"location":"tenth-district-sewers","importance":"major","page":"stories/testing-dark-waters-2018-10-17","order":375,"story_date":"2018-10-17","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":22,"quote":"For a long, long moment, my entire body seizes up and my world goes white.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/testing-dark-waters-2018-10-17#:~:text=For%20a%20long%2C%20long,my%20world%20goes%20white.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Testing the Dark Waters","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-17","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/testing-dark-waters-2018-10-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/testing-dark-waters-2018-10-17#:~:text=For%20a%20long%2C%20long,my%20world%20goes%20white.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Testing the Dark Waters\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 17 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"testing-dark-waters-2018-10-17-e4","summary":"Leighbet deduces that contact with the rift made the plants, and over time the fatbergs, immune to electricity and takes samples.","participants":["leighbet","spatial-rift","fatbergs"],"location":"tenth-district-sewers","importance":"major","page":"stories/testing-dark-waters-2018-10-17","order":375,"story_date":"2018-10-17","storyline":"","source":"wizards",